.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="RSA&#x27;s key generation, encryption, and decryption are exactly mod_inverse (to find the private exponent) and fast_mod_pow (to encrypt/decrypt) -- demonstrated here with small (textbook-toy, NOT cryptographically secure) primes.">

